// Tiki-Taka manager archetype — hand-authored, NOT LLM-baked.
//
// The possession-rotation philosophy. Short passes, ball-circulation, no
// vertical commitment until the right moment. Moderate risk appetite
// (0.50) — patient but not allergic to risk; will play through midfield
// when the angles open. Maximum possession preference (catalog-high: 0.90)
// — ball-keeping IS the defensive scheme; you can't lose if you don't
// concede possession.
//
// Q32 raw-bits computation (BAKE-TIME math; never in canonical paths):
//   risk_appetite:         0.50 × 2^32 = 2_147_483_648.0 → 2_147_483_648
//   possession_preference: 0.90 × 2^32 = 3_865_470_566.4 → 3_865_470_566
//
// Tactical archetype reference resolves to content/sources/archetypes/
//   tiki-taka.ron  (validated at load time by ContentStore).
//
// Authored 2026-05-17 (T2-1b).

